ole":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Emperor of The Dark World. He wants to invade all realms with his monster horde and crush all that stands in his way. Rogles has always hated the Valis sword, so like the cartoonish supervillain he is, he made a \"dark\" version of it that only a certain futanari can wield."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Rogles is also a powerful sorcerer. His magic is so strong and so evil that it can make girls grow penises when he rapes them."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c22777"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f9/f973bf73311f9202edc268eeb657c3aaa193937b08cc0f6cfad9527f915e1e30.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b4/b4984ff29503669b9938bddf001cba47eb844819a4e3f9b56021ce927fca6d14.webp","width":179,"height":250,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"谷 俊介","creatorId":"vndb:s1576","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1576","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1576","name":"御園 行洋","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:42140","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c22778","characterName":"メガス","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c22778"},"originalCharacterName":"メガス","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Rogles' brother, another powerful magician from The Dark World. He's a cruel leader in Rogles' army and a bloodthirsty warlord. Megas' body was disfigured long ago, so his body has cyborg enhancements. He also keeps a tentacle monster underneath his cloak. That's a sure sign of an evil villain if I've ever seen one."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Deep down, despite being a rape monster, Megas is a broken man. Rogles took away what he felt was his rightful kingdom and has become obsessed with reclaiming what is rightfully his."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He also shares Rogles' uncanny ability to fuck a girl so hard she grows a penis."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c22778"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7f/7f240f346e24976ed8f84187eeb4cfbcf6ceb65e5f5f14b6f7c4578d07b96f9e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/24/2403defb785c55c40048b2930f3464e0f808b6c4a4e01df458d6671f6b608ebf.webp","width":179,"height":250,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"本多 啓吾","creatorId":"vndb:s1392","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1392","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1392","name":"高橋 伸也","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:42139","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c22779","characterName":"グラメス","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c22779"},"originalCharacterName":"グラメス","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Rogles' top general. Glames may be a rape monster from The Dark World, but he sure does care for his troops. He is a fearless warrior, an honorable duelist, and a smart tactician. He hates to see them die and is seen as a hero to rape monsters everywhere. Wait, what?"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Glames has a history with Cham. She used to be one of his soldiers and they fought side by side, until Cham quit to start a rebellion. They were once very close and Glames still has strong feelings for her."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c22779"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/91/9120febb7ddcc2618efb68fe86a0d13ed02bb279a1188201ecfde5866b9c96a6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8a/8aab434fb6243faa279585ea57521437a17ffff616327e980890b16559c226a9.webp","width":179,"height":250,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"事務 台車","creatorId":"vndb:s3506","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s3506","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3506","name":"岡 哲也","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:42143","source":"vndb"}]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p1500","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:1806","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p1500","name":"eants","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:7599:1806","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p1500","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p1500","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p1500","name":"イーアンツ有限会社","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:102860:v7987","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p1500","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p1500","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p1500","name":"イーアンツ有限会社","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:102861:v7987","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p1500","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p1500","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p1500","name":"イーアンツ有限会社","roleCodes":["developer"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:172676:v7987","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p2900","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p2900","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p2900","name":"テレネットジャパン株式会社","roleCodes":["publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:172677:v7987","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p1500","sourceC